  <s:String x:Key="S.Device.StartHint">All three apply immediately. With the notification area ticked, the X only hides the window — you quit through the icon's context menu, and a double-click brings the window back. Together with “start minimised” no window opens at all. Whether Windows starts the program lives in the registry, not in the configuration file.</s:String>
